{"seed":9983,"ability":"animal_ken","action":"read_beast","context":"explore","position":"A","target":null,"dayTicksBefore":507,"dayPartBefore":3,"grantOk":true,"grantMethod":"abilities-push","openingKcal":47250,"result":true,"resultError":null,"sayLines":["📨 Word came: Ava Garcia wants to join Haven. \"My village is gone. Yours isn't. That's the whole of it.\" — they haven't set foot here. The village will judge.","📓 Journal: Ava Garcia applied remotely.","\"Hey.\" A man, maybe 40s, with restless hands settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A man, maybe 40s, with restless hands.)","Recipe: Bark armor (Level 1). You have seen bark armor. Plates of bark laced together, worn like a shell.","🛡️ Dawn at Haven. By the fire hangs an old bark cuirass, split at the seam — somebody's grandfather wore this into the treeline and came back. The shape of it is clear: bark plates laced overlapping like shingles, vine cord. Your hands don't know it yet. Your eyes do.","A cold snap. Breath smokes. The woods go quiet.","Overnight the bank burns −520 kcal. Feast again, or spend it.","Village meal: +400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)","A man, maybe 40s, with restless hands came back with an armful of something edible, unprompted. (+100 kcal pantry)","A woman, maybe 30s: \"a climbing vine with heart-shaped leaves and knobby white tubers underground is coming back thick on the damp slope. Not new — but it's holding.\"","Marcus and Kofi lingered over the fire together.","Desmond and Sam lingered over the fire together.","Desmond and Elif lingered over the fire together.","📓 Journal: the man in his 40s, with a gap-toothed grin taught the man in his 20s, with ink-stained fingers Old World Caches.","💧 The cistern won't cover today — the hall's call, no vote needed: half rations until the water runs come back.","🤒 Diya is achy and wrung out, barely eating. Rest and clean water — or it gets worse.","— DAY 2 DAWN — The world wakes. Animals are active.","👀 Someone asks the man in his 40s, with restless hands, the musician a shop-talk question about musician work. The pause before the answer is long enough to hear.","📓 Journal: jotted down what they said (A man, maybe 40s, with restless hands).","Snow by morning. (0°C — Cold) The ground goes iron — forage thin, walking dear.","Aaron Koch reads the sky: clear tomorrow, cold.","You watch how it moves, how it breathes. It's hungry — it's looking for food, not a fight. (Read the Beast)","📓 Journal: you UNDERSTAND **Animal Ken**.","(−80 kcal — food becomes animal ken.)"],"dayBefore":1,"dayAfter":2,"spanLogged":true,"spanCrossed":true,"spanInternalDraws":11,"nestEvents":[{"evt":1,"kind":"spanEnter","ability":"animal_ken","action":"read_beast","day":1,"depth":0,"directBefore":0},{"evt":2,"kind":"drawEnter","day":1,"want":120,"frames":["Object.villageMeal","Game.villageMeal","G.<computed>","G.villageMeal","Object.wrappedVillageMeal","Object.endDay","Game.endDay","Game.endDay"]},{"evt":3,"kind":"drawExit","day":1,"want":120,"taken":400,"items":[{"name":"Dried meat","kcalEach":400,"units":1,"spoilDay":31}]},{"evt":4,"kind":"drawEnter","day":1,"want":1115,"frames":["Object.villagerMealDay","G.villagerMealDay","Object.wrappedMealDay","Object.villageEats","G.villageEats","Object.endDay","Game.endDay","Game.endDay"]},{"evt":5,"kind":"drawExit","day":1,"want":1115,"taken":1070,"items":[{"name":"Foraged food","kcalEach":100,"units":1,"spoilDay":4},{"name":"Dried meat","kcalEach":400,"units":2,"spoilDay":31},{"name":"Peanuts","kcalEach":170,"units":1,"spoilDay":61}]},{"evt":6,"kind":"drawEnter","day":1,"want":955,"frames":["Object.villagerMealDay","G.villagerMealDay","Object.wrappedMealDay","Object.villageEats","G.villageEats","Object.endDay","Game.endDay","Game.endDay"]},{"evt":7,"kind":"drawExit","day":1,"want":955,"taken":800,"items":[{"name":"Dried meat","kcalEach":40